{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "65e97a8c-40e0-8ec3-827c-20884328e8cf",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T14:33:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beatriz Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:30:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. Pardon me, is this the office that handles animal control matters?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:30:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We take those calls here, yes. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. I have a lost dog poster I would like to register, if that is something you do. Pardon me, I'm not sure of the right word for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:30:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So you've lost a dog and you want it on record with the city. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:30:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. She went missing on Sunday morning. I have put up posters, but I was told I should tell the city as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good idea. Let me get a few details down. Can I have your name first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:31:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Beatriz Cordero. Cordero, C-O-R-D-E-R-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:31:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Cordero. And what does your dog look like? Size, color, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:31:22-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She is a small dog, perhaps twenty pounds. Pardon me, she is about up to my knee. She is tan, a light tan, with a white patch on her chest and one white front paw."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tan, white chest, one white front paw. Small, around twenty pounds. Does she have a collar on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a red collar with a tag. The tag has my phone number on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:31:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Red collar with a tag. And what's her name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:31:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lola. L-O-L-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:31:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lola. And where was she last seen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:32:00-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pardon me, I don't want to be vague. She slipped out of my gate on Sunday morning and was last seen heading toward the harbor, near the wharf area. A neighbor thought she saw her by the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:32:15-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, near the harbor, Sunday morning. Let me read this back so we're sure. Lola, small tan dog, white chest and one white front paw, red collar with a tag, last seen near the harbor on Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:32:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is exactly right. Thank you for being so careful."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:32:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now for a callback number, in case someone finds her and calls us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:32:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is four zero one, five five five, zero one five six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four zero one, five five five, zero one five six. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:32:50-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pardon me, one more thing. I have been walking around with the posters all day, because this is the slow season for me. I am a tour guide, and in the winter I have very few bookings, so at least I have the time to look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that helps with the search, anyway. I'll put the report in, and I'd suggest you also check with the animal shelter directly, since found dogs often end up there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:33:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will do that today. Is there anything I need to send you, a copy of the poster perhaps?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you can drop one by City Hall, we can attach it to the report. Otherwise the description is enough for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:33:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can bring one tomorrow. Thank you very much, Mr. Haskell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:33:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Cordero. I hope Lola turns up soon. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T14:33:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
